{% set zones = [["sklep_michal","Sklep · Michal"],["prizemi_michal","Přízemí · Michal"],["prizemi_chodba_zachod","Přízemí · chodba / WC"],["1p_kuchyn","Kuchyň"],["1p_jidelna","Jídelna"],["1p_chodba","Chodba"],["1p_koupelna","Koupelna"],["2p_mama","Máma"]] %}
{% set ns = namespace(manual=[], enabled=0, known=0, manual_known=0) %}
{% for z, name in zones %}
{% set enabled = states('input_boolean.schedule_enable_' ~ z) %}
{% set manual = states('input_boolean.' ~ z ~ '_manual_override') %}
{% if enabled in ['on','off'] %}{% set ns.known = ns.known + 1 %}{% endif %}
{% if enabled == 'on' %}{% set ns.enabled = ns.enabled + 1 %}{% endif %}
{% if manual in ['on','off'] %}{% set ns.manual_known = ns.manual_known + 1 %}{% endif %}
{% if manual == 'on' %}{% set ns.manual = ns.manual + [name] %}{% endif %}
{% endfor %}
## Režim {{ states('input_select.topny_rezim') if has_value('input_select.topny_rezim') else 'neznámý' }}
**Komfortní okna teď** {{ active | count if is_state(e,'ready') and active is not none else '—' }}/8 · **Povolené rozvrhy** {{ ns.enabled if ns.known == 8 else '—' }}/8

**Ruční režim** {{ ns.manual | join(', ') if ns.manual else ('žádná místnost' if ns.manual_known == 8 else 'stav neznámý') }}

<small>Časy upravíš tlačítkem „Rozvrh“ u místnosti. Ikony ruky a kalendáře ovládají ruční režim a povolení rozvrhu.</small>

cards.styles:
/* HEATING_COMPACT_20260918 */
.bubble-climate-container {
  height: 90px !important;
  min-height: 90px !important;
  border-radius: 16px !important;
  background: var(--ha-card-background, var(--card-background-color, #fff)) !important;
  border: 1px solid var(--divider-color, #e5e7eb) !important;
  box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(15,23,42,.04) !important;
  opacity: 1 !important;
}
.bubble-climate-container .bubble-wrapper {
  display: grid !important;
  position: relative !important;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 152px !important;
  grid-template-rows: 32px 36px !important;
  gap: 2px 8px !important;
  padding: 9px 12px !important;
  box-sizing: border-box !important;
  height: 100% !important;
  width: 100% !important;
  align-items: center !important;
}
.bubble-background { inset: 0 !important; background: transparent !important; }
.bubble-content-container, .bubble-name-container { display: contents !important; }
.bubble-main-icon-container, .bubble-state { display: none !important; }
.bubble-name {
  grid-column: 1 !important;
  grid-row: 1 !important;
  display: block !important;
  color: var(--primary-text-color, #1f2937) !important;
  font-size: 15px !important;
  line-height: 16px !important;
  font-weight: 650 !important;
  white-space: normal !important;
  overflow: visible !important;
  text-overflow: clip !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  pointer-events: none !important;
}
.bubble-name-container::after {
  content: var(--zone-caption);
  grid-column: 1;
  grid-row: 2;
  align-self: center;
  color: var(--zone-ink);
  font-size: 11px;
  line-height: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  white-space: normal;
  pointer-events: none;
}
.bubble-sub-button-container {
  grid-column: 2 !important;
  grid-row: 1 !important;
  display: grid !important;
  grid-template-columns: 32px 32px minmax(0,1fr) !important;
  grid-template-rows: 32px !important;
  grid-auto-flow: row !important;
  gap: 4px !important;
  position: relative !important;
  inset: auto !important;
  width: 152px !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.bubble-sub-button {
  height: 32px !important;
  width: 32px !important;
  min-width: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
  justify-content: center !important;
  border-radius: 10px !important;
  box-shadow: none !important;
  text-shadow: none !important;
}
.bubble-sub-button:nth-child(2) {
  background: ${hass.states['input_boolean.sklep_michal_manual_override']?.state === 'on' ? '#fef3c7' : 'var(--secondary-background-color, #f3f4f6)'} !important;
  color: ${hass.states['input_boolean.sklep_michal_manual_override']?.state === 'on' ? '#92400e' : 'var(--secondary-text-color, #64748b)'} !important;
}
.bubble-sub-button:nth-child(3) {
  background: ${hass.states['input_boolean.schedule_enable_sklep_michal']?.state === 'on' ? '#dbeafe' : 'var(--secondary-background-color, #f3f4f6)'} !important;
  color: ${hass.states['input_boolean.schedule_enable_sklep_michal']?.state === 'on' ? '#1d4ed8' : 'var(--secondary-text-color, #64748b)'} !important;
}
.bubble-sub-button:nth-child(4) {
  width: 100% !important;
  background: transparent !important;
  color: var(--primary-text-color, #1f2937) !important;
  font-size: 19px !important;
  font-weight: 650 !important;
  letter-spacing: -0.5px !important;
  justify-content: flex-end !important;
}
.bubble-sub-button:nth-child(4) .bubble-sub-button-name-container {
  overflow: visible !important;
  white-space: nowrap !important;
}
.bubble-buttons-container {
  grid-column: 2 !important;
  grid-row: 2 !important;
  position: relative !important;
  inset: auto !important;
  width: 152px !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
  padding: 0 !important;
}
.bubble-temperature-container {
  width: 152px !important;
  height: 36px !important;
  background: var(--secondary-background-color, #f3f4f6) !important;
  color: var(--primary-text-color, #1f2937) !important;
  border-radius: 12px !important;
  justify-content: space-between !important;
}
.bubble-climate-minus-button, .bubble-climate-plus-button {
  flex: 0 0 38px !important;
  width: 38px !important;
  height: 36px !important;
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.bubble-climate-temp-display { font-size: 13px !important; padding: 0 !important; }

/* HEATING_STATE_GLOSS_20260918 */
.bubble-climate-container {
  --zone-rgb: var(--zone-rgb-value);
  --zone-sheen: ${hass.themes?.darkMode ? '0.08' : '0.70'};
  --zone-glow: ${hass.themes?.darkMode ? '0.20' : '0.13'};
  background:
    linear-gradient(125deg, rgba(255,255,255,var(--zone-sheen)) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 48%),
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0%, rgba(var(--zone-rgb),var(--zone-glow)) 0%, rgba(var(--zone-rgb),0) 76%),
    linear-gradient(140deg, rgba(var(--zone-rgb),0.035), rgba(var(--zone-rgb),0.085)),
    var(--ha-card-background, var(--card-background-color, #fff)) !important;
  border: 1px solid rgba(var(--zone-rgb),0.20) !important;
  box-shadow:
    0 4px 12px -5px rgba(var(--zone-rgb),0.23),
    0 2px 4px rgba(15,23,42,0.035),
    inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,var(--zone-sheen)),
    inset 0 -1px 0 rgba(var(--zone-rgb),0.045) !important;
  transition: box-shadow 180ms ease, border-color 180ms ease !important;
